<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<Project>
   <description>Katalon automation project for testing the new SCF (Supply Chain Finance) registration page. Built as part of a pilot to introduce Katalon into the QA team's workflow, starting with registration flow coverage before expanding to the rest of the SCF onboarding UI.&#xd;
&#xd;
Scope:&#xd;
&#xd;
Automated regression coverage for the new registration page (happy path, field validation, negative/edge cases)&#xd;
Environment-agnostic via Katalon Profiles (Regression, QA1, Staging, UAT) — see Profiles for environment-specific URLs/credentials&#xd;
Organized as: Test Cases (grouped by feature area) → Test Suites (grouped runs) → Object Repository (shared page objects)&#xd;
Status: Pilot / in progress — conventions (naming, folder structure, profile setup) still being established; first automated test case (registration smoke flow) built and passing as of Sept 2026.&#xd;
&#xd;
Maintainer: Danniecia Gray, in coordination with Sapna Gore, Lejla Dobric (QA)</description>
